{"articleNo":"479556","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=479556&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 국립금오공대 재학생 TOEIC Speaking 응시료 할인(30%) 혜택 안내(연 1회 한정)","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2024.04.05","hit":"5417","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">&lt;국립금오공대 재학생 정기 TOEIC Speaking</span><i style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">&nbsp;</span></i></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">응시료 30% 할인 혜택 안내&gt;</span></b></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">최근 본교</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;학생들의 어학 능력과 취업역량 강화를 위하여 한국TOEIC</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">위원회와 업무 협약을 맺었습니다. 이에&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.48px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOEIC Speaking</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.48px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">응시료 할인 혜택을 제공하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. 혜택 대상 : 국립금오공대</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;재학생, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">휴학생, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">대학원생</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">(</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">* 재학증명서 발급 대상자만 해당됨)</span></b></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&lt;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">재</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">학증명서 서류 기준&gt;</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;시험일로부터</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;3</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">개월 이내 발행된 원본서류</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">국문으로 작성된 재학증명서에 한함</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">재학증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">재학증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">휴학증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">재적증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">수료증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">졸업예정증명서</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">복학증명서 모두 가능</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">서류는 인쇄된 실물(원본)만 가능</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">모바일</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">웹화면 및 캡처본 제시 불가</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. 응시료 할인 혜택</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">: 정가 84,000원&nbsp; -&gt;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">59,000원 <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b style=\"\">(연1회)</b></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. 혜택기간 : 별도 공지가 없는 한 계속 진행할 예정</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. 접수방법 : 국립금오공대 할인 접수 링크로 신청</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\">&nbsp;(* 해당 링크를 통해 접수해야 할인 적용 가능)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; ●&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><a href=\"https://www.toeicswt.co.kr/common/cert/comp/groupLink.php?comp_type=globalkumo\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Dotum, sans-serif, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(75, 75, 75); letter-spacing: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">https://www.toeicswt.co.kr/common/cert/comp/groupLink.php?comp_type=globalkumo</span></a><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><br><br><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. 시험장소 : 전국 TOEIC Speaking 시험센터 (희망센터 선택가능)</span><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoSgjAvAagVQJroEIGsCCiA2AjgLYDGAVsgMr4BaAdAA4B2A5kA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoShNBTAEgYQJYHsCyAbA1gMwHNkBlAMQEl4zYBPACwDoAHAO0KA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.48px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br></p><div style=\"font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"></div><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; word-break: keep-all; font-family: noto, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.48px;\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
